<title>BELGIUM: Belgian banking association opens Internet site.</title>
<headline>Belgian banking association opens Internet site.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Banking Association launched a home page on the Internet on Thursday providing information about its actitivities and statistics on the country's banking sector.</p>
<p>The Internet site also provides information about the country's preparations for the launch of a European single currency and other information about monetary union.</p>
<p>The site's address is: http://www.abb-bvb.be</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
